"1. On the device, open Settings → About (on TVs: Settings → System → About) and click Build number seven times to unlock Developer options." = "1. 在裝置上開啟「設定 → 關於」（電視上是「設定 → 系統 → 關於」），連續點按「版本號碼」七次，開啟開發人員選項。";
"2. In Developer options, turn on USB debugging. To connect over the network, also turn on Network debugging (TVs and boxes) or Wireless debugging (phones and tablets, Android 11 and later)." = "2. 在開發人員選項中開啟「USB 偵錯」。要透過網路連線，還要開啟「網路偵錯」（電視和機上盒）或「無線偵錯」（手機和平板，Android 11 以上）。";
"3. Connect it by USB, or add it here by its IP address (Settings → Network shows it)." = "3. 用 USB 線連接，或在這裡輸入它的 IP 位址新增（在「設定 → 網路」中可以看到）。";
